      "category": "interaction",
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "Some signifers are so assured of their power to control devils that they sometimes reach too far. When Gredress publicly espouses the superiority of Hell, she gains a +1 status bonus to skill checks, AC, and saves for 1 day. These bonuses don't apply against devils. At the end of the day, Gredress must attempt a DC 20 Will save save or take a –1 status penalty to skill checks, AC, and saves against devils for 1 day (or –2 on a critical failure).\n\nEffect: Diabolic Certitude",
